 "level_notes": {
  "1": "Reid's 1980 thesis (CMU-CS-81-100) defines the language; DTIC hosts scans of the thesis and the 1978 user manual but returns 403 to automated checks. The 1985 Unilogic user manual is mirrored from bitsavers.",
  "0": "The original BLISS implementation is not online; the University of Edinburgh history archive preserves the IMP source of Scribe 2.12 as ported to EMAS."
 },
